## Description

Today we’re officially launching https://t.co/8fNExjZ8Dp on YC.  The web was built for humans to browse, not agents to understand.  We turn the live web into structured, continuously refreshed data for AI agents through one API.  Trusted by 400+ customers. https://t.co/PayutU4eLZ

